  "name": "hotosm_iot_railways",
  "notes": "\n\nThis theme includes all OpenStreetMap features in this area matching ( Learn what tags means [here](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Tags) ) :\n\ntags['railway'] IN ('rail','station')\n\nFeatures may have these attributes:\n\n- [name](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:name)\n- [name:en](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:name:en)\n- [railway](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:railway)\n- [ele](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:ele)\n- [operator:type](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:operator:type)\n- [layer](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:layer)\n- [addr:full](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:addr:full)\n- [addr:city](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:addr:city)\n- [source](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:source)\n\nThis dataset is one of many [OpenStreetMap exports on\nHDX](https://data.humdata.org/organization/hot).\nSee the [Humanitarian OpenStreetMap Team](http://hotosm.org/) website for more\ninformation.\n",
